Z||000000||FastHC||11-02-1999||04:32 PM||||Even after warming up my car for 5mins, sometimes as soon as I put it into Drive, the rpm drops and the engine stalls.<BR>This only happens once in a blue moon.<P>Is it the torque converter??||||reg||5
Z||000001||theogre||11-02-1999||04:41 PM||||probably not. TCC lockup problems usually show up when stopping a hot tranny. Like at a traffic light.<P>you can verify it by unpluging the TC electrical conector from the front of the tranny.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 11-02-1999).]||||reg||1
